## 3. Custom validator classes

**None.** There are no custom `ConstraintValidator` implementations or custom constraint annotations. All validation is either (a) standard Jakarta Bean Validation annotations on the DTO/entity, or (b) hand-written imperative checks inside the controller (`normalizeTelephone`, `isDisposableEmailDomain`, `isPostcodeValidForCity`, the duplicate/cap logic). Grep for `ConstraintValidator` / custom validators returned nothing relevant.

